<p class="where">Where: <a href="https://myapp.example.com/assets/app.js" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://myapp.example.com/assets/app.js</a></p>
<details><summary>Technical details (1 line)</summary><pre>Stripe secret key: sk_liv…eal1</pre></details>
<div class="fix">
<div class="fix-head"><h5>Fix prompt</h5><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="issue-1-prompt" aria-label="Copy fix prompt: A secret key is visible to anyone who visits your app">Copy</button></div>
